      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.92,
      "end_seconds": 16.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "good, thank you. Welcome, tell me what's brought you in"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.14,
      "end_seconds": 26.29,
      "duration_seconds": 9.15,
      "text": "I'm, I'm here because of a feeling of something stuck in my throat. I told my wife I'd come today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 27.62,
      "end_seconds": 44.92,
      "duration_seconds": 17.3,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Weight 96 kilos, SpO2 98 percent on room air. BMI works out to 41.6, height 152 centimetres, temperature is 36.7 degrees, BP is 115 over 77, heart rate 75."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.49,
      "end_seconds": 46.19,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.58,
      "end_seconds": 47.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "hm, okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.31,
      "end_seconds": 59.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "how much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.71,
      "end_seconds": 80.96,
      "duration_seconds": 20.25,
      "text": "I'd call it it mild. Sorry, you know, what was I saying, and I've been having eaten fish as well. There's a sharp scratch when swallowing as well. About sharp scratch when swallowing, it's worse with swallowing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.56,
      "end_seconds": 91.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "text": "Have you had a feeling of something stuck in your throat before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.21,
      "end_seconds": 99.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.51,
      "text": "I had a similar thing a couple of years ago. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.23,
      "end_seconds": 106.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Has there been any difficulty breathing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.83,
      "end_seconds": 110.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "No. No difficulty breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.3,
      "end_seconds": 115.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Any drooling, neck swelling or blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.94,
      "end_seconds": 119.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "No, no drooling, neck swelling or blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.55,
      "end_seconds": 122.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.62,
      "end_seconds": 125.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.91,
      "end_seconds": 135.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "tell me your medicines, please"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.59,
      "end_seconds": 142.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "It's, It's lansoprazole, 30 milligrams, before breakfast for my acidity."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.91,
      "end_seconds": 145.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.57,
      "end_seconds": 152.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "Hmm, you know, nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.82,
      "end_seconds": 158.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.31,
      "end_seconds": 167.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Yes, grass pollen. I get itchy eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.62,
      "end_seconds": 173.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "let's talk a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.38,
      "end_seconds": 184.9,
      "duration_seconds": 10.52,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother. I grab fast food at lunch most days. I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.81,
      "end_seconds": 188.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.28,
      "end_seconds": 195.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "I've, I've had acid reflux for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.22,
      "end_seconds": 203.25,
      "duration_seconds": 7.03,
      "text": "I follow. Right, so acid reflux is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.72,
      "end_seconds": 222.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "what about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.08,
      "end_seconds": 228.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "My brother has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.28,
      "end_seconds": 234.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "now I'm going to do a short physical check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.07,
      "end_seconds": 236.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Does that that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.59,
      "end_seconds": 249.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "I can't see anything in the throat and the neck is not tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.7,
      "end_seconds": 290.46,
      "duration_seconds": 37.76,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Having listened and examined, this is probably a possible fish bone scratch or lodged bone. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I can't rule out a pharyngeal scratch yet. Let's get a neck X-ray, for foreign body sensation. Sip water and eat soft foods; if it persists we look with a camera. I'd like you to see the ENT clinic as well, and I'll write the referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.02,
      "end_seconds": 293.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.3,
      "end_seconds": 308.94,
      "duration_seconds": 14.64,
      "text": "Please don't wait if you have trouble breathing or swallowing saliva. That's when to be seen urgently. Please come and see me if still stuck tomorrow. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.69,
      "end_seconds": 313.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Yeah, good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
